    tagline: 'A premium international online school for African diaspora families, globally mobile families and homeschoolers across the United States — Cambridge IGCSE, A-Level, IB Diploma and Pearson Edexcel taught live in US morning and afternoon hours, with full international university support. From USD 180/month.',
    seoTitle: 'International Online School & Homeschool USA | Cambridge IGCSE, A-Level & IB — Smartious',
    seoDesc: 'Premium international online school for African diaspora and globally mobile families in the USA. Cambridge IGCSE, A-Level, IB Diploma and Pearson Edexcel taught live in US time zones. For families in Houston, Atlanta, DC, New York, Dallas and beyond.',
    localFacts: ['Houston · Atlanta · DC · NYC · Dallas', 'Live US-time classes + recordings', 'Cambridge & British Council exam centres'],
    pains: 'A growing number of American families want what their local school system cannot quite deliver: an internationally recognised curriculum that keeps doors open to UK, Canadian, African and US universities; cultural continuity for African diaspora families whose children are growing up between two worlds; smaller class sizes and personalised teaching; and the flexibility to travel, relocate or train seriously in a sport or art without disrupting academics. Smartious gives these families a serious option — a Cambridge International and Edexcel-aligned online school, taught by degree-qualified specialists, with US-friendly scheduling and a real path to universities worldwide.',
    curricula: ['Cambridge IGCSE', 'Cambridge A-Level', 'IB MYP', 'IB Diploma', 'Pearson Edexcel International', 'British National Curriculum (Primary)', 'American Curriculum Support'],
    regulation: 'Homeschooling is legal in all 50 US states, though each state has its own notification and assessment requirements — ranging from minimal (Texas, Idaho, Alaska) to detailed (New York, Pennsylvania, Massachusetts). Smartious is an internationally accredited online school based in Nairobi, Kenya; we are not US-accredited and we do not replace a state-registered homeschool umbrella where one is required. Most US families using Smartious do one of three things: register as homeschoolers in their state and use Smartious as their full academic programme; combine US public/private school with Smartious for international curriculum coverage (Cambridge IGCSE, A-Level or IB); or use Smartious as a complete online school for travelling and globally mobile families who are not bound by US state requirements. We are transparent about this so families can make the right choice for their state.',
    examCentres: 'Cambridge IGCSE, Cambridge A-Level and Pearson Edexcel examinations are sat at authorised private-candidate centres across the United States. Major hubs include CIE-approved centres in major cities, the Embassy of France/British Council network for IB Diploma, and a growing list of US international schools that accept external candidates. IB Diploma examinations are administered through authorised IB World Schools. Smartious handles all examination registration, advises on the most convenient centre, and runs full mock examination programmes before the May/June and October/November series.',
